{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國紐約州政府近日與電信運營商T-Mobile達成協議，要求其取消面向低收入家庭的優惠家庭寬帶套餐中的50GB月流量限制。此前，用户每月使用量達到50GB後，下載速度便會從25Mbps驟降至600Kbps，降幅超過97%。紐約州政府認為，這種做法不符合當地《可負擔寬帶法案》（Affordable Broadband Act）的要求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586072.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.010922+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:07:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_hash":"72bf29e9ecadb6dea61ac875f7a23a8d1ccd774f8f1a39257f0a66cfbf28383c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}